  "description": "🎀 Create elegant and feminine holiday projects with this Coquette Christmas Watercolor Clipart collection featuring 25 festive illustrations inspired by bows, pastel Christmas decor, winter treats, cozy home details, and classic holiday symbols. The set combines Christmas charm with a soft coquette aesthetic for stylish seasonal designs.\n🎄 From pastel Christmas trees, ornaments, wreaths, gifts, bells, stockings, gingerbread, snow globes, and nutcrackers to slippers, a robe, festive cocoa, Santa, snowman, carousel, and holiday self-care items, this collection offers a wide variety of Christmas elements for both digital and printed projects.\n🎁 Perfect for\n– Printable & digital stickers\n– Coquette Christmas designs\n– Digital & Printable planners\n– Journals\n– Christmas scrapbook pages\n– Greeting cards\n– Gift tags\n– Holiday stationery\n– Christmas party printables\n– Christmas bucket lists\n– Christmas mugs and tumblers\n– T-shirts and sweatshirts\n– Tote bags\n– Sublimation projects\n– Seasonal social media graphics\n– Christmas invitations\n– Holiday gift packaging\n– Digital crafting\n– Printable decor\n– Print on Demand\n✨ What’s included\n– 25 PNG files with transparent backgrounds\n– 25 SVG files\n– 3000 x 3000 px\n🎀 Included illustrations\nRound Christmas gift box, gingerbread mitten cookie, Letters to Santa mailbox, pastel Christmas bell, Christmas drum, festive stocking, coquette Christmas cake, Christmas gift bag, holiday cocoa mug, fluffy Christmas slippers, festive robe, Christmas body care set, gingerbread house, Christmas wreath, snowman, Santa Claus, Christmas carousel, ornament snow globe, pastel Christmas tree, wrapped Christmas present, nutcracker, swan snow globe, decorated Christmas ornament, floral Christmas bell, holiday candy cracker\n🩰 This coquette Christmas clipart bundle is perfect for feminine holiday merchandise, Christmas planners, scrapbook projects, seasonal stickers, greeting cards, mugs, apparel, tote bags, sublimation designs, festive stationery, and Print on Demand products. Use the illustrations individually or combine them to create soft pastel Christmas collections filled with bows, classic holiday motifs, cozy details, and elegant seasonal charm.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>🎀 Create elegant and feminine holiday projects with this Coquette Christmas Watercolor Clipart collection featuring 25 festive illustrations inspired by bows, pastel Christmas decor, winter treats, cozy home details, and classic holiday symbols. The set combines Christmas charm with a soft coquette aesthetic for stylish seasonal designs.</p>\n<p>🎄 From pastel Christmas trees, ornaments, wreaths, gifts, bells, stockings, gingerbread, snow globes, and nutcrackers to slippers, a robe, festive cocoa, Santa, snowman, carousel, and holiday self-care items, this collection offers a wide variety of Christmas elements for both digital and printed projects.</p>\n<p>🎁 Perfect for<br>\n– Printable &amp; digital stickers<br>\n– Coquette Christmas designs<br>\n– Digital &amp; Printable planners<br>\n– Journals<br>\n– Christmas scrapbook pages<br>\n– Greeting cards<br>\n– Gift tags<br>\n– Holiday stationery<br>\n– Christmas party printables<br>\n– Christmas bucket lists<br>\n– Christmas mugs and tumblers<br>\n– T-shirts and sweatshirts<br>\n– Tote bags<br>\n– Sublimation projects<br>\n– Seasonal social media graphics<br>\n– Christmas invitations<br>\n– Holiday gift packaging<br>\n– Digital crafting<br>\n– Printable decor<br>\n– Print on Demand</p>\n<p>✨ What’s included<br>\n– 25 PNG files with transparent backgrounds<br>\n– 25 SVG files<br>\n– 3000 x 3000 px</p>\n<p>🎀 Included illustrations<br>\nRound Christmas gift box, gingerbread mitten cookie, Letters to Santa mailbox, pastel Christmas bell, Christmas drum, festive stocking, coquette Christmas cake, Christmas gift bag, holiday cocoa mug, fluffy Christmas slippers, festive robe, Christmas body care set, gingerbread house, Christmas wreath, snowman, Santa Claus, Christmas carousel, ornament snow globe, pastel Christmas tree, wrapped Christmas present, nutcracker, swan snow globe, decorated Christmas ornament, floral Christmas bell, holiday candy cracker</p>\n<p>🩰 This coquette Christmas clipart bundle is perfect for feminine holiday merchandise, Christmas planners, scrapbook projects, seasonal stickers, greeting cards, mugs, apparel, tote bags, sublimation designs, festive stationery, and Print on Demand products. Use the illustrations individually or combine them to create soft pastel Christmas collections filled with bows, classic holiday motifs, cozy details, and elegant seasonal charm.</p>",
